2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (MISSILE\040DATCOM\040User\047s\040Manual\040\055\0402011\040Revision)
/Author (Christopher\040C\056\040Rosema\054\040Joshua\040Doyle\054\040Lamar\040Auman\054\040Mark\040Underwood\054\040William\040Blake)
/Subject (\072\040This\040report\040is\040a\040User\047s\040Manual\040for\040the\0402011\040Revision\040of\040the\040Missile\040Datcom\040computer\040program\056\040It\040supersedes\040AFRL\055RB\055WP\055TR\0552009\0553015\056\040In\040missile\040preliminary\040design\040it\040is\040necessary\040to\040quickly\040and\040economically\040estimate\040the\040aerodynamics\040of\040a\040wide\040variety\040of\040missile\040configuration\040designs\056\040Since\040the\040ultimate\040shape\040and\040aerodynamic\040performance\040are\040so\040dependent\040upon\040the\040subsystems\040utilized\054\040such\040as\040payload\040size\054\040propulsion\040system\040selection\040and\040launch\040mechanism\054\040the\040designer\040must\040be\040capable\040of\040predicting\040a\040wide\040variety\040of\040configurations\040accurately\056\040The\040fundamental\040purpose\040of\040Missile\040Datcom\040is\040to\040provide\040an\040aerodynamic\040design\040tool\040which\040has\040the\040predictive\040accuracy\040suitable\040for\040preliminary\040design\054\040and\040the\040capability\040for\040the\040user\040to\040easily\040substitute\040methods\040to\040fit\040specific\040applications\056)
/Keywords (01\040Mar\0402011\054\040United\040States\040Air\040Force\040Stability\040and\040Control\040Digital\040DATCOM\054\040Missile\054\040Payload)
>>
endobj
